1
00:00:13,120 --> 00:00:15,620
sign: TOMB RAIDER KING

2
00:01:30,330 --> 00:01:31,710
Kyungtae: Die, you bastard!

3
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,800
Thug 2: B-Boss!

4
00:01:45,800 --> 00:01:46,670
Thug 1: Boss!

5
00:01:49,710 --> 00:01:51,580
Jooheon: I'll take good care of this.

6
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,020
Kyungtae: But... it's mine.

7
00:01:54,990 --> 00:01:56,450
Jooheon: Let me show you

8
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:59,080
Jooheon: how you properly use it.

9
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:29,620
Thug 2: H-He stabbed me!

10
00:02:29,930 --> 00:02:32,120
Jooheon: Well? Want to keep going?

11
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:42,420
Kyungjoo: What did you just say?!

12
00:02:40,420 --> 00:02:42,420
sign: XIANG GALLERY

13
00:02:42,760 --> 00:02:45,150
Kyungjoo: Jooheon Suh beat you up?

14
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:47,330
Kyungjoo: And then he did what?

15
00:02:47,330 --> 00:02:49,420
Kyungjoo: You expect me to believe that?

16
00:02:49,910 --> 00:02:51,330
Kyungtae: It's like he was possessed!

17
00:02:51,330 --> 00:02:53,980
Kyungtae: He just came at us with some crazy moves!

18
00:02:53,980 --> 00:02:57,910
Kyungtae: You should've seen the look in his eyes!

19
00:02:57,910 --> 00:03:00,120
Kyungtae: How much did he take from you?

20
00:03:00,440 --> 00:03:05,380
Kyungtae: All the money in my account
and... the Buddha statue.

21
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:06,780
Kyungjoo: What?!

22
00:03:06,780 --> 00:03:08,620
Kyungjoo: You useless little shit!

23
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:11,760
Kyungjoo: Go get it back right now, idiot!

24
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:18,750
Jooheon: Hm, strange.

25
00:03:18,750 --> 00:03:22,650
Pawnbroker: That thing isn't even worth fifty bucks.

26
00:03:22,650 --> 00:03:24,320
Pawnbroker: Might as well get rid of it.

27
00:03:26,460 --> 00:03:31,480
Jooheon: It can't just be junk if Kyungtae 
held on to it that tightly.

28
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:36,460
sign: SPY SKILL ACTIVATED
THE STATUE CONTAINS A SUSPICIOUS SUBSTANCE.

29
00:03:34,420 --> 00:03:35,980
Jooheon: A suspicious substance?

30
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:38,180
Jooheon: Don't tell me....

31
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:45,120
Jooheon: Of course.

32
00:03:59,010 --> 00:04:00,620
Jooheon: Well, look at that.

33
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:04,870
Jooheon: That’s nothing you'd 
hand over to a pawnshop.

34
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:07,660
Geonwoo: Hey, Jooheon?

35
00:04:07,660 --> 00:04:09,370
Jooheon: Hi, Geonwoo.

36
00:04:09,370 --> 00:04:13,290
sign: XIANG GALLERY

37
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:12,110
Kyungjoo: I-I am terribly sorry.

38
00:04:12,110 --> 00:04:15,060
Kyungjoo: Yes, sir.

39
00:04:15,060 --> 00:04:18,870
Kyungjoo: Of course, I truly am...

40
00:04:19,459 --> 00:04:21,370
Kyungjoo: Who is it? I'm on the phone!

41
00:04:22,910 --> 00:04:24,620
Kyungtae: K-Kyungjoo.

42
00:04:24,620 --> 00:04:27,870
Geonwoo: We received a tip
about several drug offenses.

43
00:04:27,870 --> 00:04:32,200
Kyungjoo: D-Drugs? We're law-abiding citizens!

44
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,870
Kyungjoo: All we sell is art.

45
00:04:36,200 --> 00:04:40,870
Geonwoo: We already collected the evidence.
I assume the rest is in the warehouse?

46
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:45,090
Kyungjoo: They even know about
the warehouse in Gyeonggi-do?

47
00:04:45,090 --> 00:04:48,790
Kyungjoo: Good thing every room
is password protected.

48
00:04:50,130 --> 00:04:52,470
Kyungjoo: A warehouse? And what evidence?

49
00:04:52,470 --> 00:04:54,200
Kyungjoo: Even the police cannot just...

50
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:56,420
Policeman: All 600 pieces of art have been checked!

51
00:04:57,510 --> 00:04:59,940
Policeman: We found drugs in all of them.

52
00:05:01,090 --> 00:05:05,170
Kyungjoo: Y-You... opened all the rooms?!

53
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:07,580
Detective: Nice and quiet now.

54
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:11,230
Kyungjoo: But every room had
a different password. How?

55
00:05:11,230 --> 00:05:13,670
Geonwoo: One moment, ma'am.

56
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,650
Geonwoo: For you.

57
00:05:16,610 --> 00:05:20,110
Jooheon: Maybe you should've
lived a little more decently.

58
00:05:19,330 --> 00:05:21,830
Kyungjoo: N-No … Jooheon Suh?

59
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:26,740
Jooheon: Passwords need to be changed
every now and then, you know?

60
00:05:26,740 --> 00:05:29,830
Jooheon: Well... enjoy prison.

61
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:34,440
Kyungjoo: You filthy little rat!

62
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:36,080
Kyungjoo: I'll kill you for this!

63
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:51,620
sign: GEONWOO

64
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:51,620
sign: YOU’LL GET YOUR
100 MILLION WON REWARD SOON.

65
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:51,620
sign: DON’T BLOW IT ALL
AND SAVE THE MONEY!

66
00:05:44,620 --> 00:05:46,820
Geonwoo: You'll get your 100 
million won reward soon.

67
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:49,240
Geonwoo: Don't blow it all and save the money!

68
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:51,620
Jooheon: He worries way too much.

69
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:54,400
Jooheon: That takes care of my starting capital.

70
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,580
Jooheon: First, I'll get some sleep.

71
00:05:56,580 --> 00:06:00,380
Jooheon: Then tomorrow, the tomb hunt begins.

72
00:06:06,490 --> 00:06:09,460
Jooheon: What the? Where's my apartment?

73
00:06:09,460 --> 00:06:11,920
Jooheon: Did a tomb... appear here?

74
00:06:14,210 --> 00:06:17,370
Jooheon: Is this good or bad luck?

75
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:25,620
Citizen 1: Yeah, it's unbelievable.

76
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:26,870
Citizen 2: How is this possible?

77
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:30,370
Linda: Yes, I just arrived.

78
00:06:33,690 --> 00:06:36,850
Linda: Korea doesn't know
about the tombs yet, correct?

79
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,860
Linda: We'll be detonating this one soon.

80
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:43,370
Linda: Yes. So far, no one seems
to have recognized it as a tomb.

81
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:44,890
Linda: Understood.

82
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,870
Kiyoshi: Hello there.

83
00:06:47,310 --> 00:06:48,870
Linda: You?

84
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:53,080
Kiyoshi: Why so surprised, Linda Walker?

85
00:06:53,590 --> 00:06:56,890
Linda: What is the Japanese
excavation team doing here?

86
00:06:56,890 --> 00:07:00,870
Kiyoshi: That’s hardly something
someone from the States should ask.

87
00:07:01,290 --> 00:07:02,870
Kiyoshi: How's the jet lag?

88
00:07:03,210 --> 00:07:06,870
Linda: So we're full-on thieves now, Abe?

89
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:10,940
Kiyoshi: Come on, we both know what 
we're after. Why the hypocrisy?

90
00:07:10,940 --> 00:07:14,120
Kiyoshi: Save your energy. The relic is ours.

91
00:07:14,570 --> 00:07:16,310
Jooheon: Well, well.

92
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:22,700
Jooheon: The CIA and the Japanese 
team are already here.

93
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:26,620
Jooheon: But what kind of amateur
would blow up a tomb?

94
00:07:27,210 --> 00:07:30,620
Jooheon: Good. Looks like 
there's no experts around.

95
00:07:33,610 --> 00:07:35,050
Jooheon: Aren't these...

96
00:07:37,550 --> 00:07:39,870
Jooheon: Yes, without a doubt – tomb glyphs.

97
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:45,510
Jooheon: The language of those damned relics.

98
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:47,820
Jooheon: The funny part is:

99
00:07:47,820 --> 00:07:51,520
Jooheon: These relics go into great detail
writing about themselves.

100
00:07:52,400 --> 00:07:57,460
Jooheon: If you can read the glyphs, you'll find
out where the entrance and traps are.

101
00:08:00,730 --> 00:08:03,460
Jooheon: This is going great already.

102
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,600
Jooheon: Let's start reading, then.

103
00:08:10,460 --> 00:08:12,620
sign: [EXPERT CRYPTOGRAPHER]
YOU HAVE GAINED A NEW TITLE AND UNLOCKED A SKILL.

104
00:08:12,620 --> 00:08:15,210
sign: TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS
LINGUISTICS (RANK F) HAS BEEN ACTIVATED.

105
00:08:13,310 --> 00:08:16,380
Jooheon: Ha, how generous of that winged bastard.

106
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:16,960
sign: TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS (2/4)

107
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:16,960
sign: SPY [RANK F]
DETECT EVERYTHING IN A 1 METER RADIUS

108
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:16,960
sign: LINGUISTICS [RANK F]
IMPROVED UNDERSTANDING WITH ALL LANGUAGES

109
00:08:17,910 --> 00:08:22,210
Jooheon: Perfect. Only two skills left.

110
00:08:25,260 --> 00:08:26,840
Jooheon: This should be the place.

111
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:32,460
Jooheon: All right, let's go!

112
00:08:54,010 --> 00:08:55,250
Kiyoshi: What is that?

113
00:08:56,690 --> 00:08:59,060
CIA Agent: The tomb entrance seems to be opening!

114
00:08:59,060 --> 00:09:01,650
Linda: What? It's opening?

115
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,450
Kiyoshi: What a spectacle!

116
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:14,710
Linda: How is this happening?

117
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:27,090
Jooheon: Something should be 
showing up around here by now.

118
00:09:33,110 --> 00:09:34,230
Jooheon: Ah.

119
00:09:35,580 --> 00:09:37,200
Jooheon: This is the right place.

120
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:48,170
Jooheon: Found it.

121
00:10:01,210 --> 00:10:04,540
Jooheon: Hm. This should do it.

122
00:10:13,330 --> 00:10:15,180
Snake: Oh, a visitor.

123
00:10:25,860 --> 00:10:30,220
Snake: Yet another poor soul
has dropped his treasure.

124
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:31,540
Snake: Speak.

125
00:10:32,130 --> 00:10:34,540
Jooheon: Hey, over here!

126
00:10:35,290 --> 00:10:36,600
Jooheon: Can't you see me?

127
00:10:36,600 --> 00:10:37,660
Snake: Hm?

128
00:10:38,350 --> 00:10:40,460
Snake: You blind old serpent!

129
00:10:44,350 --> 00:10:45,810
Snake: Now, then...

130
00:10:46,530 --> 00:10:50,580
Snake: The gold knife or the silver knife.
Which one is yours?

131
00:10:51,840 --> 00:10:54,910
Jooheon: This relic is based on
"The Gold Axe and the Silver Axe".

132
00:10:55,880 --> 00:11:00,510
Jooheon: A very famous story that originates 
from one of Aesop's fables, 

133
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:03,490
Jooheon: with variations found all over the world.

134
00:11:03,860 --> 00:11:07,530
Jooheon: Even foreigners can
clear this tomb easily.

135
00:11:07,530 --> 00:11:10,420
Jooheon: But this time, it's my turn first.

136
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:13,670
Snake: I await your answer.

137
00:11:14,060 --> 00:11:17,670
Jooheon: Unfortunately, neither one is mine.

138
00:11:18,290 --> 00:11:22,170
Snake: Oh-ho. An honest human.

139
00:11:22,640 --> 00:11:26,750
Snake: Then perhaps this one belongs to you?

140
00:11:29,890 --> 00:11:31,860
Jooheon: You bet it does.

141
00:11:31,860 --> 00:11:36,840
Jooheon: If I say yes, I get my knife, 
a gold axe, and a silver axe.

142
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,370
Jooheon: That would clear the tomb.

143
00:11:38,370 --> 00:11:39,560
Jooheon: But...

144
00:11:40,380 --> 00:11:44,120
Jooheon: May I take a closer look at it?

145
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,180
Snake: Of course.

146
00:11:54,890 --> 00:11:58,120
Snake: What do you think you're doing?!

147
00:11:58,490 --> 00:12:01,120
Jooheon: Shut up. I don't trust you things.

148
00:12:02,170 --> 00:12:06,510
Jooheon: There's no guarantee
you'll reward me fairly.

149
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:09,530
Jooheon: Your gift could easily turn me

150
00:12:09,530 --> 00:12:12,120
Jooheon: into a deranged murderer.

151
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:15,730
Snake: H-How do you know about that, human?

152
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:18,540
Jooheon: I think it happened in the US back then.

153
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:25,040
sign: SERIAL KILLINGS IN THE STATES

154
00:12:18,540 --> 00:12:25,040
sign: RELIC USER CAUSES YET ANOTHER TRAGEDY

155
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:22,860
Jooheon: At the time, the axe relic

156
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:25,040
Jooheon: turned its user into a serial killer.

157
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:32,470
Jooheon: This is your end.

158
00:12:32,470 --> 00:12:34,000
Jooheon: So...

159
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:42,250
Jooheon: submit already, relic!

160
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:48,750
Snake: So this is how you plan to claim me?

161
00:12:48,750 --> 00:12:50,420
Jooheon: Let's see how strong you are.

162
00:12:51,060 --> 00:12:53,250
Jooheon: I'll use "dominance" to subdue you!

163
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:08,790
Jooheon: Affinity: The ability 
to control relics through trust.

164
00:13:09,350 --> 00:13:14,790
Jooheon: Dominance – the ability 
to coerce and force a relic to obey.

165
00:13:15,330 --> 00:13:16,710
Jooheon: And compatibility.

166
00:13:16,710 --> 00:13:19,420
Jooheon: The ideal bond between relic and master.

167
00:13:19,420 --> 00:13:23,250
Jooheon: Like a musician with an instrument relic.

168
00:13:38,110 --> 00:13:40,160
Jooheon: You... stubborn worm!

169
00:13:46,200 --> 00:13:48,460
Snake: Away! Begone!

170
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:52,710
Jooheon: I'm not going to suck up to you relics!

171
00:13:52,710 --> 00:13:56,120
Jooheon: I don't give a damn
about affinity this time round.

172
00:13:56,870 --> 00:13:59,340
Jooheon: Obey me, relic!

173
00:13:59,340 --> 00:14:02,790
Jooheon: Or I'll destroy you.

174
00:14:03,290 --> 00:14:05,040
Jooheon: Do you think I won't do it?!

175
00:14:05,600 --> 00:14:09,790
Snake: Enough, you lunatic!

176
00:14:29,740 --> 00:14:31,460
Jooheon: What a pest.

177
00:14:31,460 --> 00:14:33,570
Jooheon: You should've obeyed from the start.

178
00:14:41,620 --> 00:14:43,540
Jooheon: Will you look at that shine.

179
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:44,670
sign: [TOMB SURVIVOR]
YOU HAVE GAINED A NEW TITLE AND UNLOCKED A SKILL.

180
00:14:44,670 --> 00:14:46,620
sign: TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS
TOMB EXCAVATION [RANK F] HAS BEEN ACTIVATED.

181
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:49,040
sign: TOMB RAIDER BASIC SKILLS (3/4)

182
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:49,040
sign: SPY [RANK F]
DETECT EVERYTHING IN A 1 METER RADIUS

183
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:49,040
sign: LINGUISTICS [RANK F]
IMPROVED UNDERSTANDING WITH ALL LANGUAGES

184
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:49,040
sign: TOMB EXCAVATION [RANK F]
INCREASED UNDERSTANDING OF TOMBS

185
00:14:49,290 --> 00:14:51,890
Jooheon: Oh, a new skill.

186
00:14:51,890 --> 00:14:56,570
Jooheon: Only one more left.
How should I unlock it?

187
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:03,540
sign: [ABUSER OF RELICS]

188
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:03,540
sign: YOU HAVE ACQUIRED A NEW TITLE.
YOUR DOMINANCE HAS INCREASED.

189
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:03,540
sign: YOUR AFFINITY HAS DECREASED.

190
00:15:00,950 --> 00:15:03,540
Jooheon: "Abuser of Relics"?

191
00:15:03,820 --> 00:15:06,090
Jooheon: "Abuser" of all things, hah.

192
00:15:06,090 --> 00:15:08,310
Jooheon: You damn crow, 

193
00:15:08,310 --> 00:15:11,460
Jooheon: you're trying to mess with me, aren't you?

194
00:15:11,460 --> 00:15:12,830
Kiyoshi: It should be right ahead...

195
00:15:13,490 --> 00:15:15,330
Kiyoshi: There's the pond!

196
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:19,840
Kiyoshi: Just as the prophecy foretold.

197
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:23,330
Kiyoshi: Come on out, relic.

198
00:15:25,330 --> 00:15:27,080
Linda: W-What are you doing?

199
00:15:27,380 --> 00:15:30,330
Jooheon: You idiots are too late.

200
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,080
Kiyoshi: Why is nothing happening?

201
00:15:36,460 --> 00:15:41,020
Kiyoshi: The prophet said all I needed to do
was throw a relic in the pond!

202
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:42,080
Linda: A prophet?

203
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:46,080
Linda: So Japan really does
have a prophecy relic.

204
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:50,240
Kiyoshi: N-No! Stop trying to get intel from me!

205
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:52,330
Kiyoshi: What's going on now?

206
00:15:52,910 --> 00:15:54,800
Linda: A-An earthquake.

207
00:15:59,830 --> 00:16:01,830
Kiyoshi: Damn it, something's wrong!

208
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:05,830
Kiyoshi: We have to get out!

209
00:16:11,870 --> 00:16:15,830
sign: XIANG GALLERY

210
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:15,830
Seungwoo: Damn it!

211
00:16:16,200 --> 00:16:19,330
Seungwoo: They really took everything.

212
00:16:19,750 --> 00:16:24,260
Thug 1: With both of our bosses arrested
this business is finished …

213
00:16:24,260 --> 00:16:26,020
Seungwoo: I'm aware, dumbass.

214
00:16:26,020 --> 00:16:30,330
Seungwoo: And it's all Jooheon Suh's fault.

215
00:16:30,580 --> 00:16:32,460
Seungwoo: But this isn't over.

216
00:16:32,860 --> 00:16:37,710
Thug 2: Yeah, that’s more like it!
Are you gonna kick his ass?

217
00:16:37,980 --> 00:16:40,540
Seungwoo: Duh! Nobody gets away from me.

218
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:44,290
Seungwoo: Or else I wouldn't be Seungwoo Oh!

219
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,930
Thug 1: Wow!

220
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,930
Thug 2: Wow!

221
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:48,790
sign: INCOMING CALL

222
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:48,790
sign: ERRAND BOY JOOHEON SUH

223
00:16:46,790 --> 00:16:48,790
sign: DECLINE  ACCEPT

224
00:16:49,510 --> 00:16:50,290
Seungwoo: Oh?

225
00:17:09,220 --> 00:17:12,790
Seungwoo: Y-Yeah? Hello?

226
00:17:13,109 --> 00:17:16,790
Jooheon: What took you so long?
Do you have a death wish?

227
00:17:17,800 --> 00:17:20,329
Seungwoo: W-Where's your respect, huh?

228
00:17:20,329 --> 00:17:21,329
Jooheon: Yeah, yeah.

229
00:17:21,670 --> 00:17:25,150
Jooheon: You guys need to run
a little errand for me.

230
00:17:28,349 --> 00:17:30,920
Kiyoshi: That was a total failure.

231
00:17:31,350 --> 00:17:35,000
Kiyoshi: Hm? There was another prophecy?

232
00:17:35,400 --> 00:17:39,250
Director of JSDF: A Korean beat us to it.
We only just found out.

233
00:17:39,640 --> 00:17:43,290
Kiyoshi: And you kept that from me?!

234
00:17:43,290 --> 00:17:46,440
Director of JSDF: You know what that relic user is like.

235
00:17:47,200 --> 00:17:48,250
Kiyoshi: Don't tell me

236
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:50,640
Kiyoshi: she couldn't read the kanji again.

237
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:52,380
Director of JSDF: Well, kids these days.

238
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:55,890
Director of JSDF: We're working on it.
So you keep doing your best too.

239
00:17:55,890 --> 00:17:59,310
Director of JSDF: And be careful of that Korean.

240
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,670
Kiyoshi: W-What? Why?

241
00:18:02,490 --> 00:18:04,460
Director of JSDF: The prophecy was rather grim.

242
00:18:07,720 --> 00:18:10,130
Director of JSDF: He's called
"the one who will devour the world."

243
00:18:11,030 --> 00:18:13,540
Seungwoo: What? Midas?!

244
00:18:13,890 --> 00:18:16,890
Jooheon: Midas is the world's
largest secret auction house

245
00:18:16,890 --> 00:18:19,310
Jooheon: based in Las Vegas.

246
00:18:20,400 --> 00:18:24,790
Jooheon: If I keep an eye on what's going on there, 
I might learn what Kwon is planning.

247
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:29,710
Jooheon: Go to this month's auction
to find a few items and a person for me.

248
00:18:29,710 --> 00:18:32,290
Jooheon: Look for Jack Kayman, also known as JK.

249
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,290
Jooheon: That's his alias.

250
00:18:34,600 --> 00:18:38,200
Seungwoo: Don't be ridiculous!
How are we supposed to get in there?

251
00:18:38,200 --> 00:18:40,550
Jooheon: Figure that out yourselves.

252
00:18:40,550 --> 00:18:44,020
Jooheon: I'll pay well, 
so expenses won't be an issue.

253
00:18:44,020 --> 00:18:45,850
Jooheon: I won't be forcing you, of course.

254
00:18:47,750 --> 00:18:49,860
Jooheon: You do have a choice:

255
00:18:50,640 --> 00:18:53,920
Jooheon: Go willingly, or I'll beat you there.

256
00:18:59,370 --> 00:19:00,950
Worker: Goodbye!

257
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:07,420
Jooheon: Good. That should cover
the preparations for now.

258
00:19:10,060 --> 00:19:13,420
Jooheon: Time to go relic hunting.

259
00:19:11,690 --> 00:19:14,040
Newscaster: Breaking news.

260
00:19:14,040 --> 00:19:17,420
Newscaster: This marks the fourth murder
reported this month.

261
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:21,690
Newscaster: The suspect allegedly attempted
suicide by self-immolation.

262
00:19:17,420 --> 00:19:23,420
sign: SUICIDE ATTEMPT NEAR YEONGDEUNGPO STATION

263
00:19:21,690 --> 00:19:23,420
Newscaster: According to witnesses...

264
00:19:23,710 --> 00:19:28,980
Jooheon: Just like how it was back then, 
before a new tomb appeared.

265
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:36,330
Kiyoshi: Hey! Watch where you're going!

266
00:19:36,750 --> 00:19:40,500
Jooheon: Oh? That’s the guy I locked in the tomb.

267
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:44,500
Jooheon: If he's here, then

268
00:19:42,500 --> 00:19:44,500
Kiyoshi: How about an apology?

269
00:19:44,840 --> 00:19:47,210
Jooheon: the next tomb must be appearing soon.

270
00:19:47,620 --> 00:19:51,450
Jooheon: Around this time, 
someone in Japan had a prophecy relic.

271
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:52,290
Kiyoshi: What are you staring at?

272
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:57,440
Jooheon: And it looks like this guy
also has a relic on him.

273
00:19:57,440 --> 00:20:01,660
Jooheon: That dumbass isn't even hiding its aura.

274
00:19:58,660 --> 00:20:01,660
Kiyoshi: Something wrong with your head?

275
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:03,040
Jooheon: Whatever it is, I want it.

276
00:20:01,660 --> 00:20:03,040
Kiyoshi: Hey!

277
00:20:03,420 --> 00:20:05,540
Kiyoshi: Are you even listening to me?!

278
00:20:07,660 --> 00:20:08,960
Kiyoshi: What the hell?!

279
00:20:09,990 --> 00:20:12,460
Jooheon: Oh, I'm terribly sorry.

280
00:20:12,730 --> 00:20:15,460
Kiyoshi: It's all over my clothes!

281
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:19,040
Kiyoshi: You better pay for dry cleaning!
This is expensive!

282
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,460
Jooheon: Sadly, I don't have any money.

283
00:20:23,550 --> 00:20:25,690
Jooheon: It doesn't look expensive anyway.

284
00:20:25,690 --> 00:20:26,840
Kiyoshi: Excuse me?

285
00:20:28,080 --> 00:20:29,830
sign: JAPANESE EXCAVATION TEAM

286
00:20:31,550 --> 00:20:34,580
Jooheon: You dropped your ID.

287
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:36,580
Kiyoshi: G-Give that to me!

288
00:20:36,950 --> 00:20:38,660
Kiyoshi: Did he recognize me?

289
00:20:38,660 --> 00:20:41,540
Kiyoshi: No one can know that the JSDF is in Korea.

290
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:58,860
Jooheon: Bingo! A tomb manifestation.

291
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:01,000
Jooheon: A new one is appearing right now.

292
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:03,410
Kiyoshi: Good. Just like the prophecy.

293
00:21:07,250 --> 00:21:09,820
Kiyoshi: Hello? The manifestation has just begun.

294
00:21:09,820 --> 00:21:12,530
Director of JSDF: I know. We also received a prophecy

295
00:21:12,530 --> 00:21:15,600
Director of JSDF: that the Korean with 
the axe relic is near you.

296
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:18,460
Director of JSDF: And that you, for some reason, 

297
00:21:18,460 --> 00:21:21,210
Director of JSDF: should be careful around alcohol.

298
00:21:23,120 --> 00:21:24,210
Kiyoshi: That little shit

299
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:27,370
Kiyoshi: was the guy from the prophecy?
